(text "Regenerated from the baseline netlist (tag baseline-2026-11-23-locked) with\nthe Phase 2 pin re-use: PC10/PC11/PC12 = SPI3 SCK/MISO/MOSI (AF6) slot bus,\nSCK/MOSI through 33R source resistors; PE0/PE1/PD11 = slot CS decoder A0-A2,\nPD13 = decoder enable (100k pull-down = no slot selected); PC9 = SLOT_RST_N\nvia 33R (100k pull-down = slots held in reset, also forces GLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW\nlow); PB4 = SLOT_EXP_INT_N; PB5 = ID_MUX_RST_N (10k pull-up on the backplane:\nmuxes run at MCU reset, pulse low to recover a stuck ID bus); PB6 =\nID_WP_UNLOCK (100k pull-down, drives the ID_WP FET); PB7 = RC_ALLOW (100k\npull-down: rail cut off until firmware allows it); PB10/PB11 = I2C2 SCL/SDA\n(AF4, DS12110 rev 10) for the slot ID bus; PA? MUXB_OUT ADC pin = SLOT_ANA;\nPE13 = SLOT_ANA_EN (U109 EN, 100k pull-down); MUX_A0-2 100k pull-downs.\nBaseline sheet notes: docs/modular/mainboard_sheet_notes.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 284.48 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "425e319a-ca5a-419f-a62d-df7a6a7d498a"))
(embedded_fonts no))
